CropDuster: This is the Gem Stone Station Menu.
CropDuster: To the left, there are 4 empty gem sockets. Any gems mounted will populate there. You can alternatively check your character sheet while outside of this menu to view  your gems as well.
CropDuster: The wall of text towards the middle is a summary of the total bonuses being applied to your weapon and character.
CropDuster: On the right, you can see your inventories and any gems you have on hand.
CropDuster: To mount a gem to your weapon, click on a gem in your inventory, and click the 'Mount' Button. The gem will populate the next available socket.
CropDuster: Socketed gems will not be reversable. To remove gems, you will have to hit the reset button towards the bottom of the menu.
CropDuster: More Gems can be found in Tower through 'Gem' Chests. The gems will vary in appearance, rarity, and effects. Don't be afraid to try different combinations! There will always be more to find.
CropDuster: That's all there is to it. Go ahead and socket that gem you were given! Remember that it is a unique gem, so once you depart with it, that will be it. \
\
Good luck! May your bounty be plentiful.